h applications from eligible families.  Construction of nearly fourteen thousand houses will reach roof level soon.  Funds are available, and beneficiaries' payments must be expedited.  Banks will receive more home loan applications for affordable housing projects.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/jharkhand-government-targets-one-lakh-new-pmay-urban-houses-approval-this-year/133025119?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-43758/133025119.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}